<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Aug trade surplus 132.4 mln rand.</title>
<headline>S.African Aug trade surplus 132.4 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa recorded a trade surplus of 132.4 million rand in August from a 2.58 billion rand surplus in July, latest South African Revenue Service figures show.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists forecast an average 760 million rand surplus.  </p>
<p>(Data in billions of rand - rounded)</p>
<p>			Aug '96		Jul '96	    Aug '95</p>
<p>Exports	     10.68		  13.72		9.24</p>
<p>Imports	     10.55		  11.14		9.76</p>
<p>Balance		0.13		   2.58	     -0.52</p>
<p>			Jan-Aug '96	 Jan-Aug '95</p>
<p>Exports	     78.34		  67.49</p>
<p>Imports	     74.75		  66.18</p>
<p>Balance		3.59		   1.31</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)</p>
